# Knovaryn CODEOWNERS
#
# This file declares which maintainers are automatically requested for review
# when files change. It is a placeholder until maintainers are appointed; the
# @knovaryn/maintainers team below should be replaced with real handles/teams
# once the project is public.
#
# See https://docs.github.com/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Default owner for everything not otherwise matched.
* @knovaryn/maintainers

# Root governance and community files.
/CONTRIBUTING.md @knovaryn/maintainers
/GOVERNANCE.md  @knovaryn/maintainers
/SUPPORT.md     @knovaryn/maintainers
/MAINTAINERS.md @knovaryn/maintainers
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md @knovaryn/maintainers
/SECURITY.md    @knovaryn/maintainers
/ROADMAP.md     @knovaryn/maintainers
/CHANGELOG.md   @knovaryn/maintainers

# Documentation (any change to docs/ requires a docs-aware review).
/docs/          @knovaryn/maintainers

# Security-sensitive areas: always pull in the security maintainer(s).
/src/knovaryn/infrastructure/intake/   @knovaryn/maintainers
/src/knovaryn/infrastructure/auth/     @knovaryn/maintainers
/SECURITY.md                           @knovaryn/maintainers
